at problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/65169\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nIf the instance fails the type cast, in `Instantiate<T>` the user gets an exception, and in `InstantiateOrNull<T>` the user gets null. Either way, the node that was just instantiated is not accessible and can't be freed, so it's leaked. Now we free the node before returning in those cases so it's not leaked.\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124013/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124013/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}